| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| PROXY runtime but hero shows VPN node ID (or vice versa) | UI used `vpn.nodeId.ifBlank { proxy.nodeId }` instead of active runtime | Hero: `viewModel.nodeId()` only — keyed off `plan.runtime` |

