### `Join chip flashes JOINING during Doze`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Row chip shows Joining while hero shows Paused (Doze) | `joinChipStatus` treats null `networkRuntime` as JOINING even when lifecycle is `PAUSED_DOZE` | Return `null` (hide chip) for `PAUSED_DOZE` and `STOPPED` before the null-map → JOINING fallback |

